WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:05.500
There are plenty of big secrets at the SCP
Foundation, but sometimes, you’ve just gotta

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.300
wonder: What are the smaller secrets?

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:12.790
Here at SCP Explained, we often zoom out to
give you a bird’s eye view of the bizarre

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:17.860
and sometimes inexplicable events concerning
a huge number of anomalies.

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:22.500
But today, we’re ditching our telescope
in favor of a microscope, to take a look into

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:29.480
the daily life of one very special blobby
boy: SCP-999, the Tickle Monster.

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:36.489
We took the liberty of painstakingly stalking
-er, uh, I mean, observing SCP-999 going about

00:00:36.489 --> 00:00:40.129
his daily life, bringing joy to everyone around
him.

00:00:40.129 --> 00:00:44.649
And not only were our otherwise cold, dead
hearts thoroughly warmed, we were also able

00:00:44.649 --> 00:00:49.190
to compile everything we needed to make the
video you’re watching right now.

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:53.180
Welcome, one and all, to a Day In The Life
of SCP-999.

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:55.800
6:30 AM.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:57.520
Rise and shine, happy campers!

00:00:57.520 --> 00:01:01.629
We discovered that the Tickle Monster likes
to start his day nice and early.

00:01:01.629 --> 00:01:05.520
After all, the more daylight you have out
there, the easier it is to put the sunshine

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:07.080
in people’s hearts.

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:13.910
So shortly after waking up, SCP-999 uses his
little blobby pseudopods to put on some pleasant

00:01:13.910 --> 00:01:16.750
easy-listening music in his containment chamber.

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:17.750
Delightful.

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:22.360
He then drinks a glass of delicious soy milk
and helps himself to a balanced breakfast

00:01:22.360 --> 00:01:26.760
of chocolate, M&amp;Ms, and a variety of tasty
fruit-flavored gummies.

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:31.930
Please note: This is NOT an acceptable balanced
breakfast for human beings, it’s important

00:01:31.930 --> 00:01:37.490
to remember that SCP-999 has very different
dietary needs to us humans.

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:42.660
Believe me, I tried the SCP-999 diet, all
I got was severe sugar headaches and overtime

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:44.270
on the toilet.

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:46.800
But the less said about that, the better.

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:51.320
After eating his delicious sugary breakfast,
the Tickle monster grabs a crayon and starts

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:56.810
building his day plan, which is normally filled
with a wide array of stimulating activities.

00:01:56.810 --> 00:02:01.630
Every day is a new journey into excitement
for SCP-999.

00:02:01.630 --> 00:02:06.320
This is part of SCP-999’s schedule that
we very much recommend you emulate.

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:10.939
Setting your goals nice and early may help
you solidify your goals nice and early, and

00:02:10.939 --> 00:02:15.290
also help you feel a warm and fuzzy sense
of accomplishment when the day ends and all

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:16.870
your errands are complete.

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:21.469
But by the time all this is done for SCP-999,
it’s already…

00:02:21.469 --> 00:02:23.230
8:00 AM.

00:02:23.230 --> 00:02:28.420
Of course, while setting goals for the day
ahead is an important task, SCP-999, in its

00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:32.560
surprisingly applicable wisdom, also knows
the power of inspiration.

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:37.730
That’s why, at around 8:00 AM, the Tickle
Monster indulges in his morning entertainment

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:41.040
before any tasks or cross-tests begin.

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:45.200
This largely involves watching cartoons on
a television set provided to him by his handlers

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:47.709
at the SCP Foundation.

00:02:47.709 --> 00:02:53.540
SCP-999’s favorite shows include Spongebob
Squarepants, Blue’s Clues, and The Backyardigans.

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:58.969
The Foundation is extremely careful with the
programming that SCP-999 is allowed to indulge

00:02:58.969 --> 00:03:03.739
in, making sure that all of the shows are
generally wholesome and sweet, with positive

00:03:03.739 --> 00:03:07.529
moral messages that one can carry forward
into their day.

00:03:07.529 --> 00:03:12.450
Spongebob is a particular favorite for that
exact reason - The Tickle Monster sees that

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:17.900
plucky yellow sponge as a kind of kindred
spirit, reminding him to keep a positive,

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:21.510
can-do attitude and a sense of childlike fun.

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:27.170
After a few episodes of the show, 999 is typically
bouncing with joy, and more than feeling Spongebob’s

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:30.159
iconic catchphrase - “I’m ready!”

00:03:30.159 --> 00:03:33.370
And while it isn’t necessarily relevant,
we’d also like to state that within the

00:03:33.370 --> 00:03:36.450
confines of this metaphor, Doctor Gears is
Squidward.

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:37.660
Moving on.

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:38.879
10:00 AM.

00:03:38.879 --> 00:03:42.620
Now the Tickle Monster is really ready to
take on the day!

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:47.810
Having filled up on the two essential Cs of
any prosperous day - Candy and Cartoons - he’s

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:50.359
ready to slither out there and make a difference.

00:03:50.359 --> 00:03:54.650
His first order of business for the work day
is sitting in on the daily Site-19 Senior

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:59.010
Researcher meeting, where the top brass of
the site is given a collective debrief on

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:03.919
the day’s tasks, and given an opportunity
to share any vital information.

00:04:03.919 --> 00:04:08.739
Of course, morning meetings can be stressful,
especially when you work at the SCP Foundation,

00:04:08.739 --> 00:04:14.260
where your daily task might be, “SCP-682
seems particularly cantankerous today, mind

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:17.510
paying a visit to his containment chamber
and asking him about it?”

00:04:17.510 --> 00:04:22.810
However, SCP-999 being there in the room is
kind of like having the ultimate scented candle.

00:04:22.810 --> 00:04:27.870
He exudes those chill, relaxing vibes, and
even the pleasant smell, that puts you in

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:30.280
a place of profound ease.

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:36.180
The Foundation has discovered that since SCP-999
has started sitting in on the morning meetings,

00:04:36.180 --> 00:04:40.650
both employee satisfaction and task completion
have increased.

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:44.530
Happy workers, as it turns out, are also hard
workers.

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:48.760
When the meetings end and the senior researchers
are filing out of the room, each one of them

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:55.470
gives SCP-999 a little hug or a pat in hopes
of thanking him for all he does.

00:04:55.470 --> 00:04:58.960
This increases their emotional well-being
as well as SCP-999’s.

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:05.120
It’s one of the rare “everyone wins”
scenarios you’ll find at the SCP Foundation.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:10.490
After the meeting, SCP-999 tends to roam around
the site for a while, searching for anyone

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:11.490
in need.

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:16.180
As you probably already know, the Tickle Monster
has an innate sense for when people are in

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:19.690
need of his unique brand of anomalous positivity.

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:25.540
If a researcher or a guard is feeling down,
SCP-999 will have an innate sense of their

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:31.000
presence, and mercilessly hunt them down to
give them some pep they’ll never forget.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:35.660
Allow us to give you a specific example: Security
Officer Dan Richardson was stressed.

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:40.229
While he didn’t let on to anyone else working
at the Foundation, fearing that showing emotion

00:05:40.229 --> 00:05:44.949
would make people think less of him, his wife
was actually struggling from a severe illness.

00:05:44.949 --> 00:05:49.460
So when he went into work, even when he was
guarding the containment chambers of truly

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:55.580
terrifying monsters like SCP-106, he was only
ever worrying about her.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.009
Nobody else knew…

00:05:57.009 --> 00:05:58.430
Except for SCP-999.

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:04.280
When the Tickle Monster sensed Dan’s distress,
he slithered over and began to climb on him,

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:07.139
unleashing his rays of anomalous good vibes.

00:06:07.139 --> 00:06:11.069
Soon enough, Dan felt a kind of freedom he
hadn’t experienced since the beginning of

00:06:11.069 --> 00:06:12.530
his wife’s illness.

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:16.860
Later that day, he felt the courage to visit
the Site-19 employee mental health counselor

00:06:16.860 --> 00:06:20.580
at last, and became open about his emotional
struggles.

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:26.710
It began a long but worthwhile road to recovery,
all of which began with SCP-999.

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:28.980
And then, the Tickle Monster broke for lunch.

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:29.980
12:00 PM.

00:06:29.980 --> 00:06:37.550
At around midday, every day, SCP-999 slithers
on over to the main Site-19 cafeteria to enjoy

00:06:37.550 --> 00:06:42.139
a wholesome lunch with Foundation personnel
and some of the other friendly anomalies that

00:06:42.139 --> 00:06:43.260
do lunch with them.

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:47.949
He’ll grab a bowl of ice cream and a colorful
jello pot from the friendly lunch lady, and

00:06:47.949 --> 00:06:54.689
slither on over to the table where SCP-073,
Cain, and SCP-343, God, are sitting around,

00:06:54.689 --> 00:06:55.689
chatting.

00:06:55.689 --> 00:06:59.449
“No hard feelings about the whole, uh, mark
thing, right?”

00:06:59.449 --> 00:07:01.800
God says, biting into his hamburger.

00:07:01.800 --> 00:07:04.729
“It’s a process,” Cain replies.

00:07:04.729 --> 00:07:10.750
Any awkwardness that was there before immediately
evaporated when SCP-999 entered the scene.

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:15.379
Both of these mysterious anomalies smiled
and began petting him as he cooed and trilled.

00:07:15.379 --> 00:07:21.439
God levitated the spoon to feed 999 his ice
cream - Which Cain thought was a little show-offy

00:07:21.439 --> 00:07:24.189
but held his tongue because he was lost in
the moment.

00:07:24.189 --> 00:07:29.030
Cain helped 999 peel off the lid of his hello
pot with his precise, mechanical fingers.

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:34.909
Dr. Clef, who was eating a few tables cover,
also dropped in to give SCP-999 a playful

00:07:34.909 --> 00:07:36.319
pat on the head.

00:07:36.319 --> 00:07:41.449
And given that Dr. Clef typically has the
sensibility of an Xbox 360 Call of Duty lobby,

00:07:41.449 --> 00:07:44.710
this show of vulnerability was an exceptional
act indeed.

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:49.219
Dr. Bright would have done the same, but he
was spending lunch in O5 Council detention

00:07:49.219 --> 00:07:53.030
again because he did something really stupid
again.

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:54.419
What was it this time?

00:07:54.419 --> 00:07:55.810
See if you can guess.

00:07:55.810 --> 00:07:57.499
1:30 PM.

00:07:57.499 --> 00:08:02.619
After lunch, SCP-999 would spend the next
half an hour having the nature of his father

00:08:02.619 --> 00:08:05.610
- the terrifying Scarlet King - explained
to him.

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:11.069
For those privy to certain secret documents,
you’ll know that SCP-999 comes from the

00:08:11.069 --> 00:08:16.350
most unlikely of parents: The interdimensional,
universe-destroying monarch of chaos and evil

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:18.700
known as the Scarlet King.

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:23.499
He was actually the progeny of the Scarlet
King’s seventh bride, whose son was prophesied

00:08:23.499 --> 00:08:28.911
to one day defeat and dethrone the Scarlet
King - Not through violence and hatred, but

00:08:28.911 --> 00:08:33.690
through a love and kindness so great it burns
out the Crimson Khan’s darkness.

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:38.190
Of course, he’s not ready to go toe to toe
with his estranged father just yet, nor would

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:39.750
the Foundation want him to.

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:44.810
They’ve made mistakes in the past by being
too gung-ho in prematurely weaponizing anomalies

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:46.300
under their care.

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:50.050
Just look at the absolute disaster that unfolded
when they tried to make Able part of a Mobile

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:54.450
Task Force, and he killed all his Foundation
comrades when they ran out of missions to

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:55.450
give him.

00:08:55.450 --> 00:09:00.300
That’s why they’ve decided to take a very
different approach with SCP-999.

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:05.029
Rather than pushing him too hard, too early,
they’ve decided to start drip-feeding him

00:09:05.029 --> 00:09:08.950
the knowledge, piece by piece, every day after
lunch.

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:13.350
Some of the more scholarly researchers have
been reading him choice extracts from Daevite

00:09:13.350 --> 00:09:15.940
Scriptures concerning the Scarlet King.

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:20.730
They always follow it up with a little Rupert
the Bear, though, just so things don’t get

00:09:20.730 --> 00:09:21.730
too intense.

00:09:21.730 --> 00:09:22.730
2:00 PM.

00:09:22.730 --> 00:09:29.110
After this unique SCP Foundation take on storytime
is done, SCP-999 is once again free to roam

00:09:29.110 --> 00:09:33.120
around the site, dispensing joy to whoever
needs it most.

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:38.050
Something you need to understand about SCP-999
is that he’s utterly non-judgmental.

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:43.600
Even a beast of pure violence and hatred,
like SCP-682, is considered a potential friend

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:45.180
to 999.

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:49.670
You may even remember the time that 999 was
able to live up to his name and tickle the

00:09:49.670 --> 00:09:55.130
Hard to Destroy Reptile into submission, inducing
a hysterical laughing fit in this otherwise

00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:56.420
hardcore beastie.

00:09:56.420 --> 00:10:02.480
That’s why 999 would sometimes stray into
the dark, spooky areas of the site that most

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:06.630
people would fear to tread if they weren’t
specifically assigned there.

00:10:06.630 --> 00:10:12.330
For starters, he nestled up against the outside
of SCP-049, the Plague Doctor’s, cell.

00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:16.420
The sinister surgeon was feeling a little
down in the dumps due to his continued failure

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:22.279
to stamp out the Pestilence, and the SCP Foundation’s
stubborn unwillingness to help him in that

00:10:22.279 --> 00:10:23.279
task.

00:10:23.279 --> 00:10:27.860
However, a loving visit from the Tickle Monster,
even on the other side of a plexiglass divider,

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:32.510
was enough to chase the blues away, just when
he needed the encouragement most.

00:10:32.510 --> 00:10:36.500
This strengthened the Doctor’s resolve:
He would continue his research, no matter

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:39.850
how many lives it took to perfect his curative
method!

00:10:39.850 --> 00:10:46.410
Admittedly, not the best result of an interaction
with SCP-999, but 999 was at least happy that

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:51.730
the peculiar beaked man seemed a little less
depressed now, at least - even if that lack

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:55.130
of depression may lead to a few further murders
down the line.

00:10:55.130 --> 00:11:00.750
Who would be next on SCP-999’s rampage of
joyfulness and positive vibes?

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:05.310
SCP-999, like the benevolent Kaiju Gamera,
is a friend to all children, so he does what

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:10.949
he can to improve the quality of life for
anomalous children contained by the SCP Foundation.

00:11:10.949 --> 00:11:17.139
As part of his daily rounds, he makes sure
to always visit SCP-053, the Young Girl, as

00:11:17.139 --> 00:11:21.930
his positivity aura is too powerful for the
girl’s anomalous ability to passively cause

00:11:21.930 --> 00:11:24.570
paranoia and violence to affect him.

00:11:24.570 --> 00:11:28.670
She often reports having a wonderful time
during their sessions, though she wishes her

00:11:28.670 --> 00:11:32.610
big dragon friend could come join in on their
tea parties, too.

00:11:32.610 --> 00:11:33.820
4:00 PM.

00:11:33.820 --> 00:11:39.850
By this time, SCP-999 is back to roaming again,
searching out people or anomalies he can land

00:11:39.850 --> 00:11:41.579
a helping hand to.

00:11:41.579 --> 00:11:46.760
Helping people, if you hadn’t somehow realized
it by now, is one of 999’s greatest joy

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:47.760
in life.

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:51.980
That’s why, when slithering near the high-security
humanoid containment wing and seeing groups

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:57.260
of researchers running for the hills, he got
the sense that perhaps he was needed here,

00:11:57.260 --> 00:11:59.440
and decided to investigate further.

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:05.060
As all of the researchers ran, screaming,
in one direction, SCP-999 slithered audaciously

00:12:05.060 --> 00:12:06.060
in the other.

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:08.829
He heard one of the researchers yelling, “The
Old Man got out!

00:12:08.829 --> 00:12:10.720
Sound the alarm and run for your lives!”

00:12:10.720 --> 00:12:16.850
Of course, this did nothing to deter SCP-999,
even as the containment breach sirens blasted

00:12:16.850 --> 00:12:18.490
through the air around him.

00:12:18.490 --> 00:12:22.510
999 didn’t fear death - he only feared failure.

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:27.769
Failure in the task to make everyone around
him as happy as possible, up to and including

00:12:27.769 --> 00:12:34.029
some of the most horrific and depraved monsters
the SCP Foundation has ever contained, very

00:12:34.029 --> 00:12:37.850
much including the monstrous creature coming
towards him down the hall.

00:12:37.850 --> 00:12:44.410
The Old Man, SCP-106, gave a throaty chuckle
as he shuffled down the tiles, his black goo

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:45.740
fizzling on the ground.

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:50.180
With one hand, he traced his fingertips along
the wall with his fingertips, spreading corruption

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:52.829
that ate away at the wall like cancer.

00:12:52.829 --> 00:12:56.600
With his other hand, he dragged a rapidly
melting corpse that had once been a hapless

00:12:56.600 --> 00:13:01.290
researcher standing too close to the wall
of 106’s containment chamber.

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:06.459
Now, the Old Man was eager to cause more pain
and havoc in the rest of the facility before

00:13:06.459 --> 00:13:09.089
he was forced back to containment.

00:13:09.089 --> 00:13:13.320
Until he ran into SCP-999 coming towards him
in the hallway.

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:17.050
Suddenly, SCP-106 felt something change inside
his mind.

00:13:17.050 --> 00:13:23.990
His typically sharp, predatory, sadistic thoughts
suddenly felt odd and fuzzy, almost formless.

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:28.430
It was almost like he’d been hit by some
kind of anomalous chloroform that dulled the

00:13:28.430 --> 00:13:29.980
edge of his evil.

00:13:29.980 --> 00:13:30.980
And then…

00:13:30.980 --> 00:13:32.300
He was laughing.

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:33.360
Why?

00:13:33.360 --> 00:13:39.130
Because this strange blobby creature had crawled
up onto his body and begun to tickle him relentlessly.

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:43.940
It didn’t make sense; how come this creature
wasn’t affected by his corrosive mucus!?

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:47.889
But it was already too late, he was doubled
over on the floor, cackling.

00:13:47.889 --> 00:13:53.069
And unlucky for the Old Man, but luckily for
everyone else, it was enough to pacify him

00:13:53.069 --> 00:13:58.160
until a Mobile Task Force with high-intensity
lights showed up and shepherded him back into

00:13:58.160 --> 00:13:59.160
containment.

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:04.750
It was a truly humiliating defeat for SCP-106,
but, at the same time, he’d be churlish

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:07.870
to deny that he had somewhat of a good time…

00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:09.390
7:00 PM.

00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:14.330
As we get deeper into the evening, SCP-999
still has plenty to do.

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:19.540
After all, every day that ends at the SCP
Foundation also heralds the end of many people’s

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:22.160
lives - and that’s on a good day, too.

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:25.880
Needless to say, there would always be plenty
of people who needed cheering up at the end

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:30.819
of each day, and nobody was more up to the
task than the Tickle Monster.

00:14:30.819 --> 00:14:36.510
First, SCP-999 decided to make its way down
to the Site-19 medical bay to treat everyone

00:14:36.510 --> 00:14:40.699
who’d experienced varying degrees of horrific
injury from a typical day’s work at the

00:14:40.699 --> 00:14:42.060
Foundation.

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:43.899
Some were horrifyingly burned.

00:14:43.899 --> 00:14:45.540
Others were missing parts.

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:49.950
Some were pretty much catatonic with the mental
trauma of the things they’d seen.

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:55.190
Many had distinctive fresh wounds that could
have only come from SCP-682’s massive claws

00:14:55.190 --> 00:14:56.420
and fangs.

00:14:56.420 --> 00:14:59.260
It was a powerful wellspring of misery.

00:14:59.260 --> 00:15:04.029
SCP-999 slithered from bed to bed, nuzzling
up to the different patients of the medical

00:15:04.029 --> 00:15:05.810
bay and lifting their moods.

00:15:05.810 --> 00:15:09.850
You’d be amazed at the medicinal benefits
of a positive mindset, and he’s one of the

00:15:09.850 --> 00:15:15.150
few medical treatments that won’t utterly
destroy you if you don’t have insurance.

00:15:15.150 --> 00:15:19.519
After helping the injured, SCP-999 decided
to visit the D-Class barracks.

00:15:19.519 --> 00:15:24.440
While most of the SCP Foundation looked down
on the lowly D-Classes, especially given the

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:29.970
criminal history of many of them, but SCP-999
held no such prejudices.

00:15:29.970 --> 00:15:33.790
He sensed that the people in the barracks
were confused and scared for their safety,

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:36.950
and that was enough for him to get in there
and help.

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:40.750
He slithered through the gangway, observing
that some of the bunk beds were empty from

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:43.610
the day’s less successful tests.

00:15:43.610 --> 00:15:48.480
These hardened criminals, many of which were
literal murderers, immediately felt themselves

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:51.829
softening in the presence of this cheerful
blobby creature.

00:15:51.829 --> 00:15:56.819
For the first time in many of their long,
difficult, and tragic lives, they dared to

00:15:56.819 --> 00:16:02.730
believe that perhaps everything might be okay
again sometime in the not-so-distant future.

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:06.560
And SCP-999 couldn’t be happier about that.

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:07.980
9:30 PM.

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:14.050
As the night winds down, one of the researchers
assigned to SCP-999 reads him a bedtime story

00:16:14.050 --> 00:16:17.570
to help him wind down after an exciting day.

00:16:17.570 --> 00:16:22.690
SCP-999 tries not to go to bed too late at
night, knowing that an early bedtime and an

00:16:22.690 --> 00:16:25.490
early rise ensure health and energy.

00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:31.160
Whalesong and white noise is played over a
small radio while SCP-999 settles down to

00:16:31.160 --> 00:16:34.370
sleep, ready to have only the sweetest dreams.

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:36.920
So ends another wonderful day.

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:41.449
And there you have it, folks, a day in the
life of the endlessly adorable SCP-999.

00:16:41.449 --> 00:16:45.759
Is there anything from the Tickle Monster’s
daily routine that you think you might start

00:16:45.759 --> 00:16:48.399
incorporating into your own day-to-day lives?

00:16:48.399 --> 00:16:49.759
Let us know down in the comments.

00:16:49.759 --> 00:16:54.519
Personally, in a world that can sometimes
be cold and cruel, we think having the strength

00:16:54.519 --> 00:16:59.209
to be a little kinder, and smile a little
brighter, can make a far bigger difference

00:16:59.209 --> 00:17:02.240
to some people than you’ll ever understand.

00:17:02.240 --> 00:17:06.049
And nobody exemplifies that better than SCP-999.

00:17:06.049 --> 00:17:10.500
Now go check out “SCP-999 Tickle Monster
VS.

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:18.699
the Most Evil SCPs” and “Children of SCP-001
The Scarlet King - Is SCP-999 Really His Son?”

00:17:18.699 --> 00:17:20.579
for more tales of this wholesome blobby boy!

